How to Choose Sanitary Pads for Heavy Flow and Active Days

Having a heavy period does not mean you need to stop being active. Whether you are walking, commuting, exercising, or spending a busy day outside, choosing a suitable sanitary pad can help you feel more comfortable.

Why Does Activity Matter When Choosing a Pad?

Movement can cause a sanitary pad to shift if it does not fit properly. During heavier flow, this may increase concerns about leakage.

That is why fit and secure positioning matter.

What Should an Active-Day Pad Offer?

Consider these features:

Suitable absorbency
Adequate length
Secure wings
Comfortable surface
Good fit
Coverage appropriate for your movement

The best option depends on your individual flow and activity.

