Tips for Active Days During Heavy Flow

Change your pad before starting a long activity. Carry additional pads in a small pouch and choose clothing that makes you feel comfortable.

If you are going to be away from a washroom for several hours, plan ahead.

Don't Ignore Persistent Heavy Bleeding

A sanitary pad can help manage menstrual flow, but it cannot address the underlying cause of unusually heavy bleeding.

If heavy bleeding is persistent or significantly affects your routine, speak with a healthcare professional.

